# Pinned upstream @anthropic-ai/claude-code npm package used by
# build-repack.sh to upgrade the bundled CLI beyond what's baked into the
# base .deb (see scripts/base-deb.sha256). 2.1.112 is the newest version
# still distributed as a portable cli.js runnable under a generic Node.js -
# 2.1.113 and later ship as a compiled native binary per platform
# (darwin-arm64, linux-x64, ...) with no iOS target, so they cannot run on
# iOS at all. See README.md "Why Claude Code is pinned to 2.1.112".
#
